From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:13:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add admin store onboarding endpoint, visiting card storage,
 change-password

- POST /admin/tenants (x-admin-key = ADMIN_API_KEY): creates store + owner login
  (random temporary password, bcrypt) + optional visiting card image in one transaction
- GET /stores/current/card: the logged-in store's own card image (dashboard shows it)
- POST /auth/change-password
- tenant_cards table (migration 0002) with RLS
- Dashboard: visiting card image and change-password cards
